{"event": "llm_route", "client_s": 4.148, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 23, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:31.392Z", "t_ms": 4087, "call_site": "synthesize", "agent": "synthesizer", "provider": "gemini-openrouter", "model_id": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "dimension": "cost", "rationale": "Grounded answer from 1 paper and one worker result; the low-cost model is sufficient.", "features": {"n_tasks": 1, "n_tasks_ok": 1, "n_evidence": 3, "n_papers": 1, "n_web": 0, "n_data": 0, "evidence_tokens_est": 1175, "comparison": false, "statuses": ["done"], "evidence_only": true}, "reasoning_effort": "minimal", "timeout_s": 60.0, "price_checked": "2026-10-27", "decision_id": "a34c1ce4", "provider_label": "Google Gemini (served through OpenRouter)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.435, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:33.664Z", "t_ms": 6359, "delta": "In A-MEM, relevant memories for a new interaction are retrieved through the following context"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.748, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:33.915Z", "t_ms": 6610, "delta": "-aware retrieval process:\n\n* **Query Embedding**: Given a query text $q$ representing the current interaction, the"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.859, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.102Z", "t_ms": 6797, "delta": " system generates its dense vector representation $e_q = f_{\\text{enc}}(q)$ using the same text encoder employed"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.991, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.232Z", "t_ms": 6928, "delta": " for memory notes [C2].\n* **Similarity Computation**: The system computes cosine similarity scores between the query embedding $e_"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.183, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.425Z", "t_ms": 7120, "delta": "q$ and the embeddings $e_i$ of all existing memory notes $m_i$ in the memory storage"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.352, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.594Z", "t_ms": 7289, "delta": " $\\mathcal{M}$:\n  $$s_{q,i} = \\frac{e_q \\cdot e_i"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.544, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.788Z", "t_ms": 7483, "delta": "}{|e_q||e_i|}, \\quad \\forall m_i \\in \\mathcal{M}$$ [C2]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.728, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:34.971Z", "t_ms": 7666, "delta": "\n* **Top-$k$ Selection**: The system ranks the similarity scores and retrieves the $k$ most relevant memories $\\"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.91, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:35.152Z", "t_ms": 7847, "delta": "mathcal{M}_{\\text{retrieved}} = \\{m_i \\mid \\text{rank}(s_{q,i})"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.112, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:35.354Z", "t_ms": 8050, "delta": " \\le k, m_i \\in \\mathcal{M}\\}$ [C2]. \n\nThese retrieved memories are then used to"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.364, "data": {"request_id": "192f6a72bfdb", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:13:35.607Z", "t_ms": 8302, "delta": " build a contextually appropriate prompt, supplying historical context and past experiences to enrich the agent's reasoning for the interaction [C2]."}}
